Primarily a release to fix a lockup bug related to GPS logging.  Unlrelated to the bug fix I have also
added limited support for last-command recall.  Also, based on lots of good feecback
there are a considerable number of manual updates and changes too.

* Command line recall with backspace support.  Not inline editing (yet).
* Fix interrupt conflict that locked the Voter2 if GPS io-level logging was enabled.
